	"#str_phobos1_fresko_email_4_email_subject"	"Re: 儲物櫃"
	"#str_phobos1_fresko_email_4_email_text"	"Bernard：\n我們需要你更改你那個區域的儲物櫃密碼組合。\n新密碼是 591。\nRoberts\nPhobos 實驗室保全主任"
	"#str_phobos1_fresko_email_4_email_to"	"Bernard Fresko"
